# Package-local, for the same two reasons as oracles/oracles/sortes/.gitignore:
#
# 1. It stops hatchling walking up. Without a file here it reached oracles/.gitignore, whose
#    `**/data/` rule is the only thing keeping data/oracle_family_signing_key — the family's
#    Ed25519 PRIVATE key, which signs every oracle's receipts — out of an sdist built anywhere
#    that ancestor is unreachable.
# 2. hatchling force-includes whichever exclusion file it found, bypassing `exclude`, so that
#    file WILL be published. Better this one than a map of the monorepo's secret paths. The
#    publish gate caught exactly that on 2026-10-17, before anything was uploaded.
#
# The real guarantee is the allow-list in pyproject.toml plus the gate in scripts/publish_pypi.sh.

data/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
